          "date": "2026-11-13 12:30:18.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for specific OST allocation",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for specific OST allocation\n\nlod_ost_alloc_specific() and lod_alloc_ost_list(), the allocators\nlod_comp_prep_create() dispatches to for a non-default stripe offset\nor a user-defined OST list (LOV_USER_MAGIC_SPECIFIC), had no direct\nkunit coverage: the existing lod_comp_test cases only exercise the\nRR/QoS default-offset path.\n\nAdd four cases to lod_comp_test, reusing its existing device setup\nand lod_qos_declare_object_on() stub: lod_comp_specific_test and\nlod_comp_specific_bad_offset_test drive lod_ost_alloc_specific() via\na non-default llc_stripe_offset, checking it starts at the requested\nOST and fails outright, rather than falling back, on an offset\noutside the pool once the component is marked initialized.\nlod_comp_ostlist_test and lod_comp_ostlist_bad_ost_test drive\nlod_alloc_ost_list() via a populated llc_ostlist, checking it honors\nthe list exactly, in order, and aborts rather than substitutes an\nalternate when a listed OST is absent from the device.\n\nExport lod_alloc_ost_list() and lod_ost_alloc_specific() for the\ntest module to call directly via lod_comp_prep_create().\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [claude-code]\nChange-Id: Iab459f4eb08e6706dd7b782ffc4af56700bb0174\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
